1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"listening","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/listening","task":"Mos daraja audiosini transkriptsiz tinglang; keyin yozuv bilan tekshiring.","lesson":"en-a1-06","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"cambridge","name":"Cambridge English — Activities","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"integrated","url":"https://www.cambridgeenglish.org/learning-english/activities-for-learners/","task":"A1–A2, B1–B2 yoki C1–C2 filtrini qo‘llang; dars ko‘nikmasiga mos mashqni tanlang.","lesson":"en-a1-06","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."}],"recapEvery":4,"project":false,"rights":"Original SinfQuiz content; local Flite synthetic speech. Educational references are linked, not copied."}'::jsonb) on conflict(id,revision) do nothing;
insert into public.sq_en_content(id,base_id,owner_id,level,ordinal,status,revision,payload) values('en-a1-07','en-a1-07',null,1,7,'published',1,'{"id":"en-a1-07","baseId":"en-a1-07","revision":1,"level":"A1","levelIndex":1,"order":7,"title":"Have va has: oila va buyumlar","objective":"Odamda nima borligini tasvirlaysiz.","context":"Sinfdoshlar oilasi va o‘qish uchun kerakli buyumlarni tanishtiradi.","prerequisites":["en-a1-06"],"minutes":25,"skills":["grammar","vocabulary","pronunciation","listening","reading","writing","speaking"],"rules":["I/you/we/they bilan have, he/she/it bilan has ishlatiladi. Has hozirgi zamondagi birlik shakli.","Have bu darsda egalik yoki yaqin munosabatni bildiradi: I have a sister. To be esa holat yoki kimligini aytadi: I am a student.","Do you have …? va He doesn’t have … hozirgi oddiy zamon qoidalari bilan yasaladi. Does dan keyin asosiy fe’l have bo‘ladi."],"pattern":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","examples":["I have a sister.","She has a blue bag.","We have two notebooks.","Does Ali have a pen?","He doesn’t have a ruler.","They have an English lesson."],"vocabulary":[{"id":"en-a1-07-v0","term":"sister","meaning":"opa yoki singil","ipa":"/ˈsɪstə/","collocation":"my sister","example":"I have a sister."},{"id":"en-a1-07-v1","term":"ruler","meaning":"chizg‘ich","ipa":"/ˈruːlə/","collocation":"a long ruler","example":"He doesn’t have a ruler."},{"id":"en-a1-07-v2","term":"lesson","meaning":"dars","ipa":"/ˈlesən/","collocation":"an English lesson","example":"They have an English lesson."},{"id":"en-a1-07-v3","term":"notebook","meaning":"daftar","ipa":"/ˈnəʊtbʊk/","collocation":"two notebooks","example":"We have two notebooks."}],"visuals":[{"kind":"sentence","title":"Ma’no va tuzilish","items":["I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","I have a sister.","She has a blue bag."]},{"kind":"story","title":"Vaziyatni gapga aylantiring","items":["Sinfdoshlar oilasi va o‘qish uchun kerakli buyumlarni tanishtiradi.","We have two notebooks.","He doesn’t have a ruler."]}],"pronunciation":{"focus":"Gapdagi mazmunli so‘zlarni urg‘u bilan ayting. Nuqtada to‘xtab, yozuvni qayta tinglang.","text":"Does Ali have a pen?","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a1-07-dictation.mp3"},"exercises":[{"id":"en-a1-07-choice","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"They ___ two books.","answers":["have"],"explanation":"They bilan have keladi.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","options":["have","has","is"]},{"id":"en-a1-07-gap","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"She ___ a ruler.","answers":["has"],"explanation":"I/you/we/they bilan have, he/she/it bilan has ishlatiladi. Has hozirgi zamondagi birlik shakli. Have bu darsda egalik yoki yaqin munosabatni bildiradi: I have a sister. To be esa holat yoki kimligini aytadi: I am a student. Do you have …? va He doesn’t have … hozirgi oddiy zamon qoidalari bilan yasaladi. Does dan keyin asosiy fe’l have bo‘ladi.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …"},{"id":"en-a1-07-order","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Kartalarni to‘g‘ri tartibga qo‘ying.","answers":["I have a sister."],"explanation":"I/you/we/they bilan have, he/she/it bilan has ishlatiladi. Has hozirgi zamondagi birlik shakli. Have bu darsda egalik yoki yaqin munosabatni bildiradi: I have a sister. To be esa holat yoki kimligini aytadi: I am a student. Do you have …? va He doesn’t have … hozirgi oddiy zamon qoidalari bilan yasaladi. Does dan keyin asosiy fe’l have bo‘ladi.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","tokens":["I","have","a","sister."]},{"id":"en-a1-07-fix","type":"correction","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Does he has a pen?","answers":["Does he have a pen?"],"explanation":"I/you/we/they bilan have, he/she/it bilan has ishlatiladi. Has hozirgi zamondagi birlik shakli. Have bu darsda egalik yoki yaqin munosabatni bildiradi: I have a sister. To be esa holat yoki kimligini aytadi: I am a student. Do you have …? va He doesn’t have … hozirgi oddiy zamon qoidalari bilan yasaladi. Does dan keyin asosiy fe’l have bo‘ladi.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …"},{"id":"en-a1-07-vocabulary","type":"matching","skill":"vocabulary","prompt":"So‘zlarni ma’nolari bilan moslang.","answers":["opa yoki singil","chizg‘ich","dars","daftar"],"explanation":"So‘zni alohida emas, darsdagi birikma va gap bilan eslang.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","left":["sister","ruler","lesson","notebook"],"options":["opa yoki singil","chizg‘ich","dars","daftar"]}],"reading":{"title":"Have va has: oila va buyumlar — vaziyat","text":"Aziz has a sister called Malika. She has a blue bag and two notebooks. Aziz has a black bag, but he does not have a ruler. On Monday, they have an English lesson. Their teacher asks, “Does everyone have a pen?” Aziz has two pens, so he gives one to Ali. They have everything they need before the lesson begins.","sentences":["Aziz has a sister called Malika.","She has a blue bag and two notebooks.","Aziz has a black bag, but he does not have a ruler.","On Monday, they have an English lesson.","Their teacher asks, “Does everyone have a pen?","” Aziz has two pens, so he gives one to Ali.","They have everything they need before the lesson begins."],"questions":[{"id":"en-a1-07-reading0","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Azizda qaysi buyum yo‘q?","answers":["a ruler"],"explanation":"He does not have a ruler deyiladi.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","options":["a ruler","a pen","a bag"]},{"id":"en-a1-07-reading1","type":"choice","skill":"reading","prompt":"Aziz Aliga nima beradi?","answers":["a pen"],"explanation":"Ikki ruchkadan birini Aliga beradi.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","options":["a pen","a notebook","a ruler"]},{"id":"en-a1-07-evidence","type":"evidence","skill":"reading","prompt":"Vaziyatni tanishtiradigan birinchi jumlani tanlang.","answers":["0"],"explanation":"Birinchi jumla matn vaziyatini tanishtiradi; keyingi jumlalar uni rivojlantiradi.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","options":["Aziz has a sister called Malika.","She has a blue bag and two notebooks.","Aziz has a black bag, but he does not have a ruler.","On Monday, they have an English lesson.","Their teacher asks, “Does everyone have a pen?","” Aziz has two pens, so he gives one to Ali.","They have everything they need before the lesson begins."]}]},"listening":{"title":"Suhbatni tushunish","transcript":"I have two notebooks and a pen. My sister has a ruler. Ali doesn’t have a pen today, so I give him my second pen. We have English on Monday.","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a1-07.mp3","synthetic":true,"questions":[{"id":"en-a1-07-listening0","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Chizg‘ich kimda?","answers":["the sister"],"explanation":"My sister has a ruler.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","options":["the sister","Ali","the teacher"]},{"id":"en-a1-07-listening1","type":"choice","skill":"listening","prompt":"Ingliz tili qaysi kun?","answers":["Monday"],"explanation":"We have English on Monday.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","options":["Monday","Friday","Tuesday"]},{"id":"en-a1-07-audio-table","type":"table","skill":"listening","prompt":"Tinglangan ma’lumotni jadvalga yozing.","answers":["two","Monday"],"explanation":"Jadvaldagi javoblar yozuvda aynan aytilgan. Mavjud bo‘lmagan tafsilotni taxmin qilmang.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","rows":["Daftarlar soni","Dars kuni"]},{"id":"en-a1-07-dictation","type":"dictation","skill":"listening","prompt":"Eshitgan gapingizni yozing.","answers":["Does Ali have a pen?"],"explanation":"Gapdagi asosiy so‘zlar, yordamchi fe’l va inkor saqlanishi kerak.","hint":"I have … / She has … / Does she have …? / She doesn’t have …","audio":"/english-course/v7.23/en-a1-07-dictation.mp3","transcript":"Does Ali have a pen?"}]},"writing":{"task":"O‘zingiz va oila a’zongizda bor yoki yo‘q narsalar haqida yozing.","audience":"Sinfdagi sherigingiz","minWords":30,"maxWords":90,"plan":["Vaziyatni ayting.","Darsdagi til vositasidan foydalaning.","Muhim tafsilot yoki sabab qo‘shing.","O‘qib, ma’no va shaklni tekshiring."],"model":"I have two notebooks and a blue pen. My sister has a green bag and a ruler. I don’t have a dictionary yet. We have English on Monday, so I need to bring all my things.","modelNotes":["Birinchi gap maqsadni belgilaydi.","Darsdagi tuzilma vaziyatga xizmat qiladi.","Oxirgi gap fikrni yakunlaydi."],"phrases":["I have a sister.","She has a blue bag.","We have two notebooks."],"checklist":["Topshiriq va auditoriyaga mos yozdim.","Fikrni o‘z so‘zlarim bilan ifodaladim.","Darsdagi shaklni to‘g‘ri ishlatdim.","Imlo, bog‘lanish va tinish belgilarini tekshirdim."]},"speaking":{"task":"Sherigingizdan uchta buyum haqida Do you have …? deb so‘rang.","seconds":35,"prompts":["Asosiy fikringiz nima?","Bitta tafsilot yoki misol qo‘shing.","Sherigingizning savoliga javob bering."],"rubric":["Vazifani bajarish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Bog‘langan, tushunarli nutq","Talaffuz va muloqot"]},"rubrics":{"writing":["Mazmun va vazifani bajarish","Tuzilish va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va uslub","Grammatika va imlo"],"speaking":["Vazifa va o‘zaro muloqot","Ravonlik va bog‘lanish","Til vositalari va aniqlik","Tushunarlilik va talaffuz"]},"realTask":"O‘zingiz va oila a’zongizda bor yoki yo‘q narsalar haqida yozing.","exit":[[{"id":"en-a1-07-exit0","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"He ___ a sister.","answers":["has"],"explanation":"I/you/we/they bilan have, he/she/it bilan has ishlatiladi. Has hozirgi zamondagi birlik shakli. Have bu darsda egalik yoki yaqin munosabatni bildiradi: I have a sister. To be esa holat yoki k